{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643100/extras/gif_welcome.gif?t=1744194473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your feet up &amp; let your hair down, and spend some time filling an empty void with a vibrant little landscape. Biotopia aims to be a perfect companion while listening to a podcast or an audio book, with its addictive yet unobtrusive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643100/extras/text_zen.png?t=1744194473\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643100/extras/gif_zen.gif?t=1744194473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Earn points by connecting tiles with similar biomes, and earn coveted <i>bonus tiles</i> by planning your placements carefully. Enjoy getting into the zone and staying there, plopping down pieces one by one and making the world grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643100/extras/text_demo.png?t=1744194473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo plays similarly as the full game, but is capped at level 8. There are\u00a05 Different biomes to unlock, and\u00a014 Types of animals to discover. Your progress towards seeing everything is kept across sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643100/extras/text_about.png?t=1744194473\" />Biotopia (and the demo) is under active development by a single person, and everything is still subject to change. If you have any questions, suggestions or feedback I would love to hear from you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643100?t=1744194473","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643100/89a387e31c204aebd2b1099b445c862619f6c926/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744194473","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643100/b9f6b188722942a8116166c77289ccdb1f733b7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744194473","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643100/b9f6b188722942a8116166c77289ccdb1f733b7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744194473","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643100/extras/gif_welcome.gif?t=1744194473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your feet up &amp; let your hair down, and spend some time filling an empty void with a vibrant little landscape. Biotopia aims to be a perfect companion while listening to a podcast or an audio book, with its addictive yet unobtrusive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643100/extras/text_zen.png?t=1744194473\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643100/extras/gif_zen.gif?t=1744194473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Earn points by connecting tiles with similar biomes, and earn coveted <i>bonus tiles</i> by planning your placements carefully. Enjoy getting into the zone and staying there, plopping down pieces one by one and making the world grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643100/extras/text_demo.png?t=1744194473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo plays similarly as the full game, but is capped at level 8. There are\u00a05 Different biomes to unlock, and\u00a014 Types of animals to discover. Your progress towards seeing everything is kept across sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643100/extras/text_about.png?t=1744194473\" />Biotopia (and the demo) is under active development by a single person, and everything is still subject to change. If you have any questions, suggestions or feedback I would love to hear from you!</p>","developers":["loboflex"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2363600","name":"Biotopia"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643100/1e02a8b3de541a182ed9facb590c60633d8e54a6/header.jpg?t=1744194473","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257122180,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122180/movie480.mp4?t=1744057998","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122180/movie_max.mp4?t=1744057998"},"name":"pre-alpha gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257122180/245ff7bcc06a18d7cc9da16937b55023d9b75d3c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744057998","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122180/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744057998","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122180/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744057998"}}],"n